  "notes": "Bearforj physical particle textures. One DDS per file, not an atlas. Every file is 2048x2048 DXT5 with straight alpha and lives directly in Data\\Shaders\\PhysicalParticles\\. The DDS files are added at integration and are not generated in this package. Each JSON group is one texture array; slices stay in this order, including when a file is missing at load (the loader repeats another slice in that group so indices do not shift). Leaf frames 01-04 are shape variants of one species and region. Region selection follows the player worldspace and location, with neutral as the fallback. pine_hjaal is the Hjaalmarch set: leaf_{aspen|birch|oak}_pine_hjaal and needles_pine_hjaal. Maple has no pine_hjaal set and uses neutral there. Pine trees use needles_pine_hjaal in every region, because that is the only needle set. moth_frame_01..04 is a flipbook in frame order. spark_01..04 are tinted to the spell color.",
